<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces redeployed to Jurf al-Sakhar and Jurf al-Nasr to confront the Kataib Hezbollah militia. Prime Minister Al-Zaidi ordered a crackdown on oil smuggling and set a deadline for militia withdrawal, threatening force. Iran's top IRGC commander arrived for talks with Iraqi officials amid tensions with Kataib Hezbollah. An Iran-backed militia tortured an environmentalist protecting marshes and detained a former PMF commander. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQM1BsSFlwZ3UtdGRTdml2RGtmQXN6SFV3ZDRnWEVLcWRYQ0JyQkFHSFFPcUVwaTNaTHp2bjFhdWROMzFRaFBySUxxQjZsbVNHekpWdmFHRUhqdmxwaUEwTFdQSnkzWkY5bDFJX09xMXRFY1d6ZUdIUnFpaTF1QUpoV0NpdVQwTU1JVjBINHZBZXJ0UzZsaHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQeE81RHNyWV9Jc2dPbDFQR29pcEhYZlJCc1JFR1JsT1ctM2h2MG1aaEJ0dGk3a3VobmtWYzMtWW45ZGNPaXF0YlFUbDQzMUZpRmVONzBsY2M1SS04b0VZVnZ3V2N6S0l4UC03MWRkSVdGWVN2czdYTWxab1phZC0wa2k1RHJLTTBHM2Jla1BpVW4tQkdUdWR1QWdkWlI3ZEVCQnozOS1HUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQSFp4SnYzOXRsMUp6V1hFd2VxdkhrbXQ3MEJKdF9QYVVaMUVsZENOS0t1cjFzMnNROVR6WHdVX3UwOHNmMEVzNnhvLW9TXzBpZ3RtUS1FR3o0R19ueEZfYUw2eTd4Y0ZxZ2tIbVV3eUZiRWFncmYxdWZFWkdHYm9oN29PdTVvREtZUkxzX0dJOHJkNzkwVVp6N3g5VURCRC1vSFdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPVV95bnRSWlVFU1dhSExfODRXN3Q5b1d1VHZZT2Z5Tk1nXzJBUHBFUkNibzBIY1I5NkdoeFAyU1ltNE9tYTVONzA1Smt4YWxmNWlSeVh6ZjVmMVNhbDluZGFwSW1ocExKb3Q0a1g2dFZNWFk3Vy1xclZDd0lRTVlJSFdnUU1ka29SM2wwbVhpTDJITlJzcllObUV3bFNfejhJMlBpdS0xcjIzYzRjVHR5ZE9kQktzTWZiY2VUdXFFOVVudw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters